Javier Alejandro Mascherano (pangucapan: [ˌmaskeˈɾano]) (#ALIH) ya iku juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; asalé &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; sing biyasa main minangka &lt;a href="glandhang"&gt;glandhang Bertahan&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="b%C3%A8g"&gt;bèg&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="FC%20Barcelona"&gt;Barcelona&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;.
