National Museum of American History

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
National Museum of American History inggih punika &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ngempalaken, nyimpen, saha mameraken tilas budaya &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; ing babagan sosial, pulitik, budaya, sains, sarta militèr. &lt;a href="Museum"&gt;Museum&lt;/a&gt; punika wonten ing &lt;a href="National%20Mall"&gt;National Mall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington, D.C.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Pengelolanipun inggih punika &lt;a href="Institusi%20Smithsonian"&gt;Institusi Smithsonian&lt;/a&gt;.
Sabibaripun dipunrenovasi antawis kalih taun kanthi béya AS$85 yuta, Museum Nasional Sajarah Amérika dibikak malih wiwit tanggal &lt;a href="21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="November"&gt;November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;. Koleksi utama &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; inggih punika &lt;a href="bendera%20The%20Star-Spangled%20Banner"&gt;bendera The Star-Spangled Banner&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dados inspirasi &lt;a href="Francis%20Scott%20Key"&gt;Francis Scott Key&lt;/a&gt; nalika nyerat puisi "&lt;a href="The%20Star-Spangled%20Banner"&gt;The Star-Spangled Banner&lt;/a&gt;".
Wonten ing gedhong &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; kasimpen Pusat Arsip kanthi total ambanipun rak 3.700 m.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
&lt;a href="Museum"&gt;Museum&lt;/a&gt; punika dipunresmikaken nalika taun &lt;a href="1964"&gt;1964&lt;/a&gt; kanthi nama Museum Sajarah saha Teknologi (Museum of History and Technology). &lt;a href="Museum"&gt;Museum&lt;/a&gt; mapan ing gedung ingkang minangka yasan pungkasan ingkang dipunrancang déning biro arsitèk &lt;a href="McKim%20Mead%20%26amp%3B%20White"&gt;McKim Mead &amp; White&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; gantos nama dados Museum Nasional Sajarah Amérika (The National Museum of American History). Penggantosan nama punika kanthi pangajab supados &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; langkung nedahaken ancas &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing babagan pangolahan sarta nyinaoni objek ingkang nyimpen sajarah bangsa &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;. Ing salebeting koleksi &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; wonten sepatu ajaib (&lt;a href="ruby%20slippers"&gt;ruby slippers&lt;/a&gt;) ingkang dipunagem Dorothy (&lt;a href="Judy%20Garland"&gt;Judy Garland&lt;/a&gt;) wonten ing filem &lt;a href="The%20Wizard%20of%20Oz%20%28filem%201939%29"&gt;The Wizard of Oz&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Museum"&gt;Museum&lt;/a&gt; dipuntutup antawis kalih taun wiwit tanggal 5 &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; saperlu nindakaken renovasi. Pemugaran dipuntindakaken déning biro arsitèk &lt;a href="Skidmore%2C%20Owings%20and%20Merrill"&gt;Skidmore, Owings and Merrill&lt;/a&gt; (SOM) saking &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; saha &lt;a href="Turner%20Construction"&gt;Turner Construction&lt;/a&gt;, minangka perancang gedung saha palaksana konstruksi. Gladri permanen kanggé bendera &lt;a href="The%20Star-Spangled%20Banner"&gt;The Star-Spangled Banner&lt;/a&gt; dipunrancang déning biro desain saking &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chermayeff%20%26amp%3B%20Geismar"&gt;Chermayeff &amp; Geismar&lt;/a&gt; sesarengan kaliyan SOM.
<h2>Koleksi</h2>
Koleksi.
&lt;a href="Museum"&gt;Museum&lt;/a&gt; dumunung ing gedung tigang lante. Saben sayapipun gadhah artefak wigati minangka tema utama. Wonten ing antawisipun koleksi utama &lt;a href="musiyum"&gt;musiyum&lt;/a&gt; kapanggih &lt;a href="lokomotif%20John%20Bull"&gt;lokomotif John Bull&lt;/a&gt;, teleskop damelan taun taun &lt;a href="1865"&gt;1865&lt;/a&gt;, Prastawa kafetaria Greensboro utawi méja kafetaria Greensboro, &lt;a href="patung"&gt;patung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="George%20Washington"&gt;George Washington&lt;/a&gt;, ambulans &lt;a href="Palang%20Merah%20Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Palang Merah Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, saha wahana Dumbo Si Gajah Terbang]].
