<li>Wantara 1-2 dina larva jilma dadi nimfa stadium 1 lajeng tumuwuh dadi nimfa stadium2, sing duwé sikil 8. * Nymfa iki dadi tungau wadon mudha, sing siyap &lt;a href="kawin"&gt;kawin&lt;/a&gt; karo tungau lanang</li>
