CIESIN cekaan saka tembung Center for International Earth Science Information Network ya iku organisasi nirlaba ngadek taun 1989 ing &lt;a href="Michigan"&gt;Michigan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; banjur ing taun 1998 bergabung ing kampus Lamont ing Universitas Columbia dadi pusat pérangan Earth Institute &lt;a href="EI"&gt;EI&lt;/a&gt;, CIESIN kerja raket kaliyan masarakat, alam semesta, pengelolahan mirunggan data on-line ngèlmu kawruh informatika lan mahajemen informasi, pelatihan lan penyediaan data terpadu wantara ngèlmu kawruh sing ana hubungane kaliyan manungsa lan alam lingkungane, amarga péranganing Earth Institute &lt;a href="EI"&gt;EI&lt;/a&gt;, CIESIN bekerja raket uga kaliyan para ilmuwan teka Lamont-Doherty Earth Observatory &lt;a href="LDEO"&gt;LDEO&lt;/a&gt;, International Research Institute for Climate and Society &lt;a href="IRI"&gt;IRI&lt;/a&gt;, Tropical Agriculture Program &lt;a href="TAP"&gt;TAP&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi pelopor ing jerone pengembangan cyberinfrastruktur.
